Package: pedkindraw
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Pedigree Drawings and Kinship
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("R. Mark", "Sharp", email = "rmsharp@me.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6170-6942"))
Description: Draws pedigrees as interactive 'visNetwork' graphs that can be
    annotated, and computes kinship coefficients. It also trims and shrinks
    pedigrees, checks pedigree records, finds sets of unrelated individuals,
    and converts 'kinship2' 'pedigree' and 'Pedixplorer' 'Pedigree' objects.
URL: https://github.com/rmsharp/pedkindraw
BugReports: https://github.com/rmsharp/pedkindraw/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Language: en-US
Encoding: UTF-8
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
